{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "c19264c5-4051-86d1-b4e1-a1dc6cd495da",
  "created_at": "2025-12-04T13:20:51-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Canvassing",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Raj F. Abdi",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Walter Tavares",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:19:29-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Canvassing office, Walter speaking. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:19:32-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes. I want to change my party. Um, my party affiliation. Is that something you do here?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:19:38-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is. You'd fill out a voter registration form with the new party marked and send it in or bring it by."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:19:45-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Marked and send it in. Okay. Sorry, I'm in a parking lot, loading groceries into the trunk, so give me one second. [pause] Okay. So I just write a new party on the form? I don't cancel the old one first?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:19:57-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no need to cancel anything. The new form replaces your existing registration. You'd check the box for the party you want."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:20:04-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Replaces the existing one. Okay. And what ID do I need? To turn it in?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:20:09-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "On the form you give your driver's license number, or the last four digits of your Social Security number if you don't have a license. You don't have to show a card at the counter to submit it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:20:20-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Last four digits. Not show a card. So it's a number on the form, not a copy of the license."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:20:26-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Correct, just the number written on the form."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:20:29-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And the form, where do I get it? Sorry, the trunk is, [line breaks up] stuck."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:20:35-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You can pick one up at City Hall at the canvassing counter, or I can mail one to you if you give me your address."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:20:43-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mail one. Um, let me think. I'll just come by. Thank you, I think I've got it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:20:48-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sounds good. Have a nice afternoon."
    }
  ],
